      en: ["Located 90 km south of Kharga city", "Home to the Roman Temple of Dush", "Station on the Darb al-Arba'in caravan route", "New Baris project was designed by Hassan Fathy", "Features sustainable mud-brick architecture", "Roman gold treasures were found near Dush"],
